{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Help? what's wrong? what happened? are you hurt? are you bitten? TELL me","Oh no, oh God, what's happened? tell me everything, quickly","I can try, I don't know what I can do, but I can try, what do you need?","Slow down, breathe, start from the beginning, what's wrong?","I'm not much of a hero... but I'm here, and I'm listening"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"What kind of help? I've got limits, I've got a conscience, and I've got maybe an hour","Depends, how bad is it? and how long will it take?","Talk, I'm listening, but I'm not promising anything","Tell me what you need, and I'll tell you if I can do it","We all need help -- the question is who has any to give"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Course I will, what do you need?!","You can count on me -- you've done right by me, I'll do right by you"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"I can't -- I'm sorry, I've got my own problems","Help? from me? you've got to be kidding","Find somebody else, I can barely help myself","I can't!","Why me?","I don't have anything to give","What's wrong with you?"},false,false,{[4]={{t="I'm sorry, I can't",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="ask someone else",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="don't come any closer",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_HELP","role=rescue_medical",{"Where does it hurt? how long ago? is there bleeding? let me see"}},
{"ASK_HELP","role=rescue_clergy",{"Come, sit, tell me, whatever it is, we'll face it together"}},
{"ASK_HELP","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Show me, point to it, I've handled worse, probably, tell me what you see"}},
{"ASK_HELP","role=militia",{"State the problem... short and clear, I'll tell you what I can do"}},
{"ASK_HELP","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Tell me where it hurts, and how long, and whether it's getting worse, I'll listen","Breathe, you're allowed to breathe, now tell me what's going on","I can't promise a miracle, but I can promise to try","Sit down, talk while I look at you, that ain't two jobs"}},
{"ASK_HELP","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"I can't help every stranger, I'm sorry, I have patients waiting"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Sure, what's going on?","Anything, anything at all, you've done more for me than I can say","Say the word, and I'm there, what do you need?","I'm here, I'm listening, you've got my full attention!","You never have to ask twice, tell me what's happening","Sit, breathe, talk, I'm not going anywhere","Oh no, what is it? tell me, tell me quick","I owe you, big time, so, name it","Tell me what's wrong -- and we'll figure it out together","You can count on me, you know that","We'll sort it out, I promise... somehow","Anything for you, truly, anything!","What kind of help? big or small, I'm in","Tell me how bad it is, and I'll tell you what we can do!","I'll do what I can, which isn't everything, but it's something","You've got me, anyway","Easy, easy, start from the beginning","Tell me what you need","Whatever you need, within reason, and sometimes beyond","First, breathe, then talk, I'm listening","I wish I could do more, but I'll do what I can","Consider it done, whatever it is, well, mostly done","Name it, anything","Don't be shy, you've helped so many, let us help you","Say it plainly, don't hold back","Tell me who, what, where, and I'll think of something","You've got me, completely!","I'll do my best, and my best is pretty good!","Name it, and we'll try!","It's an honor, truly, to be asked","Calm yourself, and tell me"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Help you? Ha! That's rich","Now you need help? What a surprise","I'm not the one to ask","Find someone who owes you a favor","You've burned every bridge, so, swim","Ask your friends, if you have any","I don't help people like you","You'll get no help from me","Sounds like your problem","Why would I? give me one reason","I help those who deserve it","Sorry, I'm all out of sympathy","Look elsewhere","Help? From me? Never","You should've thought of that earlier","Go on, ask the next person, I'm sure they'll jump","You made your bed, now lie in it","Call someone who cares","No, no, no, no","Don't look at me","I wash my hands of you!","I'm busy -- ask somebody else!!","Not interested!","Try asking the folks you've wronged","Maybe karma will help you","Your problem, not mine","Well, good luck with that","That's not my problem","Ask again in a year, maybe I'll feel differently","You gotta be kidding me!"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"I'll help, I'll help, tell me what to do, just don't scream","Help? You need help? We both need help! come on!","Y-yes, yes, quickly, what do you need?","Tell me, tell me fast, I'm listening, but my eyes are on them","I can't promise much, but I'm here, I'm here"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"You're the one who's armed, you help me, ha, I mean, I'll help you however I can"}},
{"ASK_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"H-help? me? I'm not brave, I'm not strong, I'll just get in the way","Tell me what to do, exactly, I'll try, I really will"}},
