{"ASK_HOPE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hope? Oh, I'm trying, I'm really trying, some mornings it's just a thread, and I hold on with both hands","It will get better, it has to, it can't get any worse, can it? don't answer that","I think so, I do, I think there's a sunrise at the end of this, I just don't know whose it will be","I-is it the end of the world? I don't know, but it's the end of MY world!","I hope so, with all my heart, I hope so every second of every minute","Some days I believe, some days I don't, today? today I'm leaning toward believing"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hope costs, and I'm broke, but I keep a little in my pocket for emergencies","It'll get better or it won't, I'm not going to waste energy guessing","The world's going on without us, always did... we're just done with how we used to live","I've seen enough to know that people are tough, tougher than the dead, I think we'll make it, some of us","The end of the world is a story people told to scare children, this is something else"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Hope? you're naive","Hoping got a lot of good people killed","Hope is for fools!!","Hope? Can't eat it","Hope? That's a joke","You can keep your hope!!","Not for me","Hope won't buy my trust - what do you want?"},false,{[8]="GENERIC"},{[5]={{t="ha",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="I'll keep my gun",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="and not for you",afterMs=3000}}}},
