{"ASK_HOPE","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hope is one in twenty patients who walks out on his own, and I count those","We delivered a baby last night, healthy as anything... and for a minute there, I believed","I'm not allowed to give up, medicine won't let me, the oath won't let me","Hope's like a fever... it comes and goes, and sometimes it breaks..."}},
{"ASK_HOPE","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"I don't hand out hope to strangers, it's a prescription!!"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Some mornings I wake up and the birds are singing","I keep a jar of seeds on the windowsill","Hope? I saw a kid share his last cracker yesterday","I don't hope for rescue anymore","I've got a daughter, and she keeps drawing the sun","Hope's funny that way","The rain stopped today","Yeah, sometimes","I hope the others made it","You find it in strange places","I'm not a hopeful person","Without hope... I'd have stopped walking days ago","I plant things"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and for about ten seconds I forget",afterMs=3500},{t="that's my hope, those ten seconds",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I can't say why",afterMs=3200},{t="somebody has to believe in spring",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="with a stranger",afterMs=3500},{t="that's about all the hope I need",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="I hope for a quiet night",afterMs=3200},{t="it's a smaller hope, but it comes true more often",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="big yellow one, with a face",afterMs=3500},{t="I hang them all up",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="it won't come when you call it",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="and I thought, well, there's that",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="not today",afterMs=3500},{t="maybe tomorrow",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="the ones I lost track of",afterMs=3200},{t="it's a stupid hope, but it's mine",afterMs=2800}},[10]={{t="a crumb, a joke, a handshake",afterMs=3500},{t="a stranger who stops to talk",afterMs=3000}},[11]={{t="but I'm a stubborn one",afterMs=3200},{t="it looks the same from the outside",afterMs=2800}},[12]={{t="so, yeah, I guess I have some",afterMs=3500}},[13]={{t="tomatoes, mostly",afterMs=3200},{t="you can't plant a tomato and not believe in July",afterMs=2800}}}},
