{"ASK_HOPE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Hope? Hope is for people with full bellies, I take what I can get and don't ask for more","There's no hope, {g:pal|lady}, the world ended, I'm just deciding how comfortable to be","Is there hope? Sure, for me and mine, everyone else can fend for themselves","I don't believe in hope, I believe in what I can hold in my hands","It's not going to get better, so you might as well enjoy what's left","End of the world? Nah, the world's fine, it's the people that are done"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Hope?! You want to talk about hope with a gun in your face?!"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I... I want to say yes, I really do, but I lie awake every night and I just can't see it","Some days I think we'll make it, then I see another one, and I don't think so, you know?","Hope's all I got left, so I hold onto it as hard as I can, even when it hurts"}},
