{"ASK_HOPE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I try to keep my people believing, I don't believe it myself, but they need me to"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Hope is for churchgoers, I'm just getting through the next hour","Some days I feel it, most days I don't, that's the truth","We lost the old world, but maybe we get a better one, if enough of us make it","Only thing that keeps me going is the thought of seeing the guys again, in one piece"}},
