{"ASK_HOPE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Hope is a pleasant fiction, I prefer evidence","I remain cautiously optimistic, but then I always was","Society will rebuild, it always does, though not necessarily with us in it","In my line of work, you learn to expect the worst and plan for the best"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I do hope, yes, quietly, privately, and I'd advise you to do the same"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Hope? I had it every day in prison, every day it was crushed, I'm done with it","It'll get better when I'm dead, maybe","What's left to hope for? Getting free's all I ever wanted, and I'm free, and I'm still miserable"}},
