{"ASK_HOPE","st=friendly,neutral",{"I can hope without pretending I know how it ends","Someone was kind to me when they didn't have to be. I keep that close","Depends when you ask. I'm not going to lie about the bad hours","I'd like to find out what a good day looks like now","Not a big shining sort of hope. Enough to keep making choices","I don't need everything to be all right before something can matter","I'm trying. Please let that count for something","Sometimes it's just curiosity. What happens if I keep going?"}},
