{"ASK_HOPE","st=friendly",{"I'd rather borrow a little from you than make up a brave answer"}},
{"ASK_HOPE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"There has to be, the Army's at the bridge - they wouldn't stay if there wasn't something to stay for, right?","I saw a woman planting tomatoes in her yard in {town} - in the middle of all this, tomatoes - so yes - some","I don't know, I'm going to keep going like there is, because the other choice is sitting down","My pastor called every bad storm the end times, he was wrong eleven summers running - I'm counting on twelve"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
